  "relation": "Unconditional iff on the SAME supplied H -> {set G} map to upstream GraphTheory.core.minor.minor_rmap, preserving host G / pattern H order. Nonempty connected disjoint branches realize H-edges in G; nested/and4, empty-intersection/disjointness and two-witness/pair-witness/neighbor presentations are equivalent. No inducedness, coverage, radius or global nonemptiness guard.",
