  "summary": [
    "C15 migrates two finite supplied branch-set interfaces to upstream minor_rmap on the same map, without a duplicate canonical definition. Nine public adapter/consequence lemmas and a public-only client cover empty-pattern/empty-host, singleton identity, empty/disconnected/overlapping branches, extra edges, unused vertices and composition.",
    "Thirteen frozen objects cover two sources, five dependent definitions and six complete statements (five corpus plus the explicit non-corpus colouring_variants boundedness declaration). All whole iff certificates preserve host/pattern order, loopless/asymmetric guards where originally present, the uniform maximum and M.-1 sharpness, the 3|D|<=5|S| conclusion and the positive-k logarithmic Erdos-Posa envelope.",
    "No previous frozen snapshot reaches this family at the baseline. All earlier bodies and frozen arrays remain unchanged. Infinite/shallow/subdivision/odd/fat/fractional/multigraph contracts remain separate. The upstream-owned fidelity verdict and machine evidence are in the registry; no artificial repository primitive override is added."
  ],
